@@ -0,0 +1,109 @@
+# Activity
+
+Activity is the API representation of the account timeline: the events that
+happened in the account, like cards being added, assigned, moved, renamed, or
+commented on.
+
+Activity is a read-only feed. To change anything, use the resources that
+generated it (cards, comments, boards, and so on).
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of the activity you have access to, newest first.
+
+The kinds of events returned mirror those shown in the HTML timeline, with two
+exceptions: the deprecated `card_collection_changed` events are omitted, and
+`card_title_changed` events are included.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by creator user ID(s) |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5vaeqs1m1w0gs5zbrp9j9q",
+    "action": "comment_created",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.553Z",
+    "description": "David commented on &quot;First!&quot;",
+    "particulars": {},
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4#comment_03f5vaer1q6z62m3ylhzwrv7y",
+    "eventable_type": "Comment",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5vaer1q6z62m3ylhzwrv7y",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.553Z",
+      "updated_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.553Z",
+      "body": {
+        "plain_text": "This looks great!",
+        "html": "<div class=\"action-text-content\"><p>This looks great!</p></div>"
+      },
+      "creator": {
+        "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+        "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+        "role": "owner",
+        "active": true,
+        "email_address": "david@example.com",
+        "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+      },
+      "card": {
+        "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4"
+      },
+      "reactions_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4/comments/03f5vaer1q6z62m3ylhzwrv7y/reactions",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4/comments/03f5vaer1q6z62m3ylhzwrv7y"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+      "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "creator": {
+        "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+        "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+        "role": "owner",
+        "active": true,
+        "email_address": "david@example.com",
+        "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+        "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+      }
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+The `description` is the description of the event in its plain-text form, like
+the one shown in the HTML timeline.
+
+`url` opens the eventable: for card events it opens the card, and for comment
+events it opens the card the comment was posted on and jumps to that comment.
+
+## Particulars
+
+The `particulars` object holds the details that are specific to each action:
+
+| Action | Particulars |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids`: the ID(s) of the users being (un)assigned |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board` and `new_board`: the board names |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title` and `new_title`: the card titles |
+| `card_triaged` | `column`: the column name |
+| All the others | none |
+
+Missing board, title, or column values are returned as empty strings.
diff --git a/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb
